{{define "code_review_ledger.tmpl"}}
## Finding ledger (earlier rounds)
Give every finding below exactly one status in previous_findings: "resolved" (the code now fixes it), "unresolved", "partially_resolved", "dispute_accepted" (the author disputed it and is right), or "dispute_rejected" (the author is wrong; say why). Closed findings need a status too: confirm they stay resolved.
{{range .Ledger}}{{data (printf "finding %s" .ID) (printf "id: %s\nstate: %s\nseverity: %s\ncategory: %s\nlocation: %s\ntitle: %s\nrequired_change: %s\nauthor_response: %s\nauthor_detail: %s" .ID .State .Severity .Category .Location .Title .RequiredChange .Response .Detail)}}

{{end}}
Report only problems that are not in the ledger as new findings.
{{end}}

